L100 -- KILLSHOT TEST PLAN: dwarf-sigma(R_gc) EFE  &  flat-a0(z) BTFR, as observing specs
======================================================================================================================
  a0 footings: canonical 9.3619e-11 / alt 1.1279e-10 m/s^2
  EFE kernel (from L89, F(Q)Theta static branch): mu(y) = 1 - e^{-y}, y = g_ext/a0
  MW field model: g_ext(R) = Vc^2/R, Vc = 180 km/s
